  "id": "betel-nut",
  "term": "betel nut",
  "definition": "Betel nut is a widely used substance that is chewed, often in betel quid or related products, as a socially accepted masticatory product. In mental health context, it is notable because it has addictive properties and is described as one of the most widely abused substances worldwide.",
